  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 204.02 Subscriptions and Veracity of Documents. All petitions, motions, and replies filed with the council shall be signed by the proponent of the document, or, if the party appears by a representative, by the representative.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7302, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9167, INTERIM, eff 6-3-08, EXPIRES: 11-30-08; ss by #9223-A, eff 8-1-08",
